- signatoryDesignation: Section Officer, Establishment Section
- phone: 011-2309 2591
- enclosures: Copy of Office Order No. A-11011/7/2025-Estt. dated 09.09.2025
Copy of the option exercised under FR 22(I)(a)(1)

Still empty: mainPoint."
`;

