Department of Personnel and Training
North Block, New Delhi - 110001
- enclosures: Statement of sanctioned and filled posts of Section Officer as on 01.04.2026 (1 page)
- copyTo: The Central Public Information Officer, Department of Expenditure — for information and necessary action under Section 6(3)

Still empty: mainPoint."
