- department: Department of Personnel and Training
- place: New Delhi
- date: 2026-08-28
- subject: Order on the representation of Shri A.B.C. against the fixation of his pay.
- paras: Shri A.B.C., Section Officer, has made a representation dated 05.06.2026 praying that his pay on promotion be re-fixed with effect from 01.07.2025.
The representation has been examined with reference to FR 22(I)(a)(1) and the Department of Expenditure O.M. dated 27.07.2017 and to the records of the case.
On the facts, the option for re-fixation was exercised beyond the period prescribed in the said O.M..
In view of the foregoing, the representation is rejected. The option is required to be exercised within one month of the date of promotion, and no ground has been shown for condoning the delay of eleven months.
The applicant may, if aggrieved, prefer an appeal to the Joint Secretary (Administration) within 45 days of the receipt of this order.
- signatoryName: A.B.C.
- signatoryDesignation: Under Secretary to the Govt. of India
- phone: 011-2309 2590
- email: us-estt@nic.in
- copyTo: The office order file.

Still empty: applicantName, applicantDesignation, representationDate, prayer, provision, finding, decision, reasons, appellateAuthority, appealDays."
